        "slot": "P",
        "id": "AhriPassive",
        "name": "Essence Theft",
        "maxRank": 0,
        "summary": "After killing 9 minions or monsters, Ahri heals.<br>After taking down an enemy champion, Ahri heals for a greater amount.",
        "bodyHtml": "Killing minions or monsters grants Ahri an Essence Fragment. After obtaining 9 Fragments, Ahri consumes them to <span class=\"text-green-600 dark:text-green-400\">restore ((35 ~ 95) + ([[si:scaleap]]20% Ability Power)) Health</span>.<br /><br />When Ahri scores a takedown against an enemy champion within 3 seconds of damaging them, she feasts upon their Essence, <span class=\"text-green-600 dark:text-green-400\">restoring ((75 ~ 165) + ([[si:scaleap]]30% Ability Power)) Health</span>.",
