        "maxRank": 3,
        "summary": "Ahri dashes forward and fires essence bolts, damaging nearby enemies. Spirit Rush can be cast up to three times before going on cooldown, and gains additional recasts when taking down enemy champions.",
        "bodyHtml": "Ahri nimbly dashes, firing 3 essence bolts at nearby enemies, prioritizing champions. These bolts deal <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(75/125/175 + ([[si:scaleap]]35% Ability Power)) magic damage</span> each. <span>Spirit Rush</span> can be <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-300\">Recast</span> up to 2 more times within 15 seconds.<br /><br />Consuming a champion's Essence with <span>Essence Theft</span> during this period extends the recast window by up to 10 seconds and grants an additional recast of <span>Spirit Rush</span> (up to 3 stored).",
